  "body": "Welcome to 27 Streamview Way - an impressive family home where space, luxury and modern living come together.\r\n\r\nDesigned for families who want more, this stunning residence offers 5 bedrooms, 4.5 bathrooms, three ensuite bedrooms and multiple living areas across two generous levels.\r\n\r\nHighlights:\r\n\r\n* 5 bedrooms | 4.5 bathrooms\r\n* 3 ensuite bedrooms\r\n* Multiple living areas\r\n* Italian marble designer kitchen\r\n* Integrated Miele appliances\r\n* Full scullery\r\n* Statement chandeliers & designer lighting\r\n* Smart home, integrated audio & CCTV security\r\n* Elevated position with Long Bay views\r\n* Double internal-access garage\r\n* 10-Year Master Build Warranty\r\n\r\nSpacious, sophisticated and designed for modern family life - all in one of Long Bay's most sought-after locations, close to schools, the beach and village amenities.\r\n\r\nBig on space. Big on style. Made for Long Bay living.\r\n\r\nCall Rachel today to arrange your private viewing.",
